WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.964 --> 00:00:03.021
code-style's SKILL.md says "Use ~old~ new names.", then "Use ~~old~~ new names.": "old" struck out each time, no tilde left

2
00:00:03.021 --> 00:00:05.002
"~a~~" and "~~a~": the closing tildes are not as many as the opening ones, so it is text

3
00:00:05.002 --> 00:00:07.007
"~~~a~~~", "~ a~" and "\~a~" are text: three tildes, a space inside, an escaped tilde

4
00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.027
"~/bin and ~/lib" is text: a tilde after punctuation, before a letter, closes nothing; "~(a)~" is struck out

5
00:00:09.027 --> 00:00:11.039
"Install to ~/bin, see [docs](https://example.edu/~jdoe/).": nothing struck out, the link goes to ~jdoe
